`W` = native forward + record ticks 1..424 (shared), `FP` = placed first packet + scratch
clear (shared), `G` = lifted record packet groups (shared), `TAIL` = lifted suffix
(groups 100..101, endpoint, copy, canon) + unprefix + X + setup (shared).
