writes the record's encoded packets 100/101 and `g 510` on the payload, the
terminal letter `g 511 = 1` on `base 2409`, the history letter `s 510` on
`base 1797`, leaves every other label of `CT` clean and touches nothing else.
-/

section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 30000
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

namespace ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairField2V3LastTail

