/-!
# Field 9 on v3: kernel checks for the row codec and the repaired orientation

Physicality of `StairPhysicalPrimitives.pack/unpack B` and soundness of
`StairV3Primitives.orient f` (LT14's `orientFull`) at the six v3 budgets, by
